BEGIN:VEVENT
CATEGORIES:Hughes Entertainment
DESCRIPTION:Keith Nelson\, an artsy high school outcast\, tries to land a 
 date with popular girl Amanda Jones with some help from his tomboy best f
 riend\, Watts. However\, Watts realizes she likes Keith as more than just
  a friend and tries to convince him to stop pursuing Amanda. Matters are 
 further complicated when Keith's invitation draws the ire of Amanda's ric
 h yet snobby ex-boyfriend\, Hardy Jenns\, who makes plans to get even.
