CATEGORIES:360 WayUp
DESCRIPTION:In Rio de Janeiro\, Noah Silva is a smooth-talking\, used-car 
 salesman whose 'do whatever it takes' approach to business and life begin
 s to unravel at home and at work. After a series of wake-up calls\, Noah 
